  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Emp 404.21 Grant Funds Used or Not Used. A WorkInvestNH grant recipient shall report to the department promptly upon determining that any portions of the dollars allocated for their grant will not be used.\n\nNew. #12960, INTERIM, eff 12-26-19, EXPIRED: 6-23-20\n\nNew. #13074, eff 7-22-20",
